Q: Extend signal form&#39;s FormField directive A: <blockquote>
<p>to add some custom classes to show valid/invalid states on my input.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>You probably just want to use:</p>
<pre class="lang-ts prettyprint-override"><code>  provideSignalFormsConfig({
    classes: {
      'my-valid': (state) =&gt; state.valid()
    }
  })
</code></pre>
